# The noun of a thing that sounds at a set time, and "for" after it: "an
# alarm for 7", "a reminder for 9".  "alarm [...] An instance of an alarm
# ringing, beeping or clanging, to give a noise signal at a certain time."
# (Wiktionary, s.v. "alarm", noun).  "reminder [...] Someone or something
# that reminds." (Wiktionary, s.v. "reminder").  "wake-up call [...] A
# telephone call to awaken someone at a certain time" (Wiktionary, s.v.
# "wake-up call"; "wakeup call" is its alternative form).  "for [...]
# Directed at; intended to belong to." (Wiktionary, s.v. "for", preposition).
alarm for
alarms for
reminder for
reminders for
wake-up call for
wake-up calls for
wakeup call for
wakeup calls for
